{"id":"c63d75bb504057a1","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-restricted-product.md","title":"Restricted Product","display":"df-restricted-product — Restricted Product","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-restricted-product","aliases":["58-df-restricted-product"],"display":"df-restricted-product — Restricted Product","depends_on":["[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-restricted-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-restricted-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-restricted-product — Restricted Product"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md\">../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(G_v,\\cdot_v)_{v\\in I}\">\\((G_v,\\cdot_v)_{v\\in I}\\)</span>（群族）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_v\\leq G_v\">\\(K_v\\leq G_v\\)</span>（指定子群族）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G_v,\\cdot_v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G_v,\\cdot_v)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K_v,G_v,\\cdot_v)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K_v,G_v,\\cdot_v)\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-group.md\">../batch09/58-df-group.md</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"59685d062adf2748\" href=\"?note=59685d062adf2748\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md\">../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod_{v\\in I}G_v\">\\(\\prod_{v\\in I}G_v\\)</span>（笛卡尔积，逐坐标运算）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod&#39;:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\">\\(\\prod&#39;:V^3\\rightharpoonup V\\)</span>，写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prod&#39;(I,G,K)=\\prod&#39;_{v\\in I}(G_v,K_v)\">\\(\\prod&#39;(I,G,K)=\\prod&#39;_{v\\in I}(G_v,K_v)\\)</span>（此处定义的 restricted-product 集合算子）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}restricted\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\forall v\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G_v,\\cdot_v)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K_v,G_v,\\cdot_v)\\bigr)\\to\\prod&#39;_{v\\in I}(G_v,K_v)\\coloneqq\\left\\{g\\in\\prod_{v\\in I}G_v:\\left|\\{v\\in I:g(v)\\notin K_v\\}\\right|&lt;\\omega\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}restricted\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\forall v\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G_v,\\cdot_v)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K_v,G_v,\\cdot_v)\\bigr)\\to\\prod&#39;_{v\\in I}(G_v,K_v)\\coloneqq\\left\\{g\\in\\prod_{v\\in I}G_v:\\left|\\{v\\in I:g(v)\\notin K_v\\}\\right|&lt;\\omega\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Restricted products impose membership in distinguished subgroups except at finitely many indices.</li>\n<li>The subgroup check carries the ambient operation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_v\">\\(\\cdot_v\\)</span>, matching the canonical three-argument subgroup predicate.</li>\n<li>若各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_v\">\\(G_v\\)</span> 为拓扑群且几乎所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_v\">\\(K_v\\)</span> 为开紧子群，还可赋予标准 restricted-product topology；该拓扑不是这里的集合/群定义自动给出的。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S(G_v,\\cdot_v)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K_v,G_v,\\cdot_v)$（见 [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]、[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md","status":"resolved","id":"59685d062adf2748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Group}_S(G_v,\\cdot_v)$ 与 $\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K_v,G_v,\\cdot_v)$（见 [[../batch09/58-df-group.md]]、[[../batch02/58-df-subgroup.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"(G_v,\\cdot_v)_{v\\in I}","display":false},{"tex":"K_v\\leq G_v","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Group}_S(G_v,\\cdot_v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K_v,G_v,\\cdot_v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod_{v\\in I}G_v","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod':V^3\\rightharpoonup V","display":false},{"tex":"\\prod'(I,G,K)=\\prod'_{v\\in I}(G_v,K_v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}restricted\\text{-}product} \\vdash \\forall v\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Group}_S(G_v,\\cdot_v)\\land\\mathrm{Subgroup}_S(K_v,G_v,\\cdot_v)\\bigr)\\to\\prod'_{v\\in I}(G_v,K_v)\\coloneqq\\left\\{g\\in\\prod_{v\\in I}G_v:\\left|\\{v\\in I:g(v)\\notin K_v\\}\\right|<\\omega\\right\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\cdot_v","display":false},{"tex":"G_v","display":false},{"tex":"K_v","display":false}],"bytes":1471,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1087","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-restricted-product.md|58-df-restricted-product]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["ed71f39f59370734","59685d062adf2748"]}